data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" undergoes a chemical reaction that increases acidity, harming marine life—particularly organisms with calcium carbonate shells, like coral.\n*","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":"   **Glacial Retreat and Sea Level Rise:** Satellite imagery confirms the rapid melting of polar ice sheets and mountain glaciers.","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" This melt, combined with the thermal expansion of warming water, has led to a measurable rise in global sea levels.\n\n","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":"#### The Effects\nThe consequences of a warming planet are not uniform; they manifest as a \"multiplier\" that exacerbates","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" existing vulnerabilities.\n\n*   **Extreme Weather:** Climate change increases the frequency and intensity of extreme events. Warmer air","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

